792	     * Build an owner's {@code membershipNumber}, the stable membership identifier derived from the
793	     * owner's own persisted fields. It is formatted {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where {@code YY}
794	     * is the last two digits of the registration date's fiscal year (see
795	     * {@link #fiscalYear(LocalDate)}), e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M27'}. The value is deterministic
796	     * in those two fields.
