863	    /**
864	     * Resolve this owner's effective {@code membershipLevel}: the capped value stored on the owner
865	     * when present (the create-time level after the household ceiling has been applied, see
866	     * {@link #getMembershipLevel()}), otherwise the level recomputed from the owner's membership
867	     * points (see {@link #membershipLevel(int)} and
868	     * {@link #membershipPoints(Integer, String, Integer, LocalDate)}). This is the single source of
869	     * truth for how a stored level is read back, deferred to by both the create-time household-ceiling
870	     * computation and the read-side DTO mapping so they always agree.
